00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:06.600
They received three million votes, which is
17 percent, and they got twenty five seats.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:12.510
But the Bloc Quebecois, which only is in Quebec,
they don't run in any other province.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.010
Yes, they got one point three million, which
is seven point six percent, and they got thirty

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:21.370
two.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:22.740
So.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:26.420
