00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:36.930
And so when the Trudeau government first came
into power in 2015, they ran on personal representation.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:42.409
But I imagine they ran the numbers if we had
something like Germany or Japan and quickly

00:01:42.409 --> 00:01:47.300
