These are two different things that are so
I can only speak to the United States and

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:13.940
the United States.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.260
There's two different things going on.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:21.749
The national popular vote Interstate Compact
is a way to use a national popular vote to

00:02:21.749 --> 00:02:27.540
choose the president without having to make
a constitutional change, which is states just

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.730
agree.

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:32.480
We will give our votes to whoever wins the
popular vote.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:35.209
So that gets us out of the Electoral College.

00:02:35.209 --> 00:02:42.919
That's one thing separately to deal with gerrymandering,
which is within states in the U.S. setting

00:02:42.919 --> 00:02:43.919
