that would solve Partizan gerrymandering within

00:02:57.569 --> 00:02:58.569
states.

00:02:58.569 --> 00:03:03.309
And it's totally separate from the national
popular vote interstate compact to different

00:03:03.309 --> 00:03:05.669
things to different problems they would solve.

00:03:05.669 --> 00:03:13.220
Speaker 3: OK, so like if the interstate compact
came into effect because enough states were

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:19.379
